# Official PokeMMO downloads and client entry points are user-supplied, never published.
# Case-insensitive patterns also cover copies renamed on Windows/macOS.
[Pp][Oo][Kk][Ee][Mm][Mm][Oo]-[Cc][Ll][Ii][Ee][Nn][Tt]*
[Pp][Oo][Kk][Ee][Mm][Mm][Oo]
[Pp][Oo][Kk][Ee][Mm][Mm][Oo]*.[Ee][Xx][Ee]
[Pp][Oo][Kk][Ee][Mm][Mm][Oo]*.[Jj][Aa][Rr]
[Pp][Oo][Kk][Ee][Mm][Mm][Oo].[Ss][Hh]

# Python tooling caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
